  "scope": "One fresh, single-node Kind v1.36.1 cluster using kubeadm-managed local PKI and stacked etcd. The case backs up the active etcd server certificate/key inside the disposable node, asks kubeadm to renew that leaf, temporarily combines the original certificate with the renewed private key, restarts etcd, and requires an explicit TLS key/certificate mismatch in etcd logs plus a failed verified health check. A node-local EXIT trap restores the original matching pair. The case then requires etcd health, API readiness, retention of a preexisting ConfigMap, and a new ConfigMap write/read. Private key bytes remain in the node. No host files, other nodes, external PKI, production clusters, or HA behavior are touched.",
